#: ../../source/sql/sql_numeric_function.md:48 c5abd959b3a1410ba2c4c962def64e3d
msgid ""
"Definition and Usage Used for data rounding; Y parameter can be ignored, the "
"default is 0; When the parameter Y is a negative integer is, X in the decimal "
"point to the left of the Y rounding (from right to left); If the parameter Y "
"is negative and greater than the number of digits before the decimal point, "
"Round returns 0."
msgstr ""
"定义和用法 用于数据舍入；Y 参数可以忽略，默认为 0；当参数 Y 为负整数时，X 在小"
"数点左侧对 Y 舍入（从右到左）；如果参数 Y 为负数且大于小数点前的位数，Round 返"
"回 0。"

#: ../../source/sql/sql_numeric_function.md 805bf53a11cb44e2b7dbf3191cba6fc5
msgid "Int, Double, Float"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/sql/sql_numeric_function.md 15c90c88543847359d57cb95e5b173ef
msgid "Required. The number to be rounded"
msgstr "必须填写。四舍五入的数字"

#: ../../source/sql/sql_numeric_function.md 070991cc7aac43f9ab3e7f676f501ea5
msgid ""
"Optional. The number of decimal places to round number to. If omitted, it "
"returns the integer (no decimals)"
msgstr "可选项。四舍五入的小数位数。如果省略，则返回整数（无小数）。"

